OL,3,GNEWSANewlyweds swap honeymoon for
OL,4,Acharity half marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is normal for most newlyweds to
OL,7,Fspend their first week of marriage
OL,8,Frelaxing on a beach but Ryan and Hannah
OL,9,FO'Shea celebrated their nuptials by
OL,10,Frunning a half marathon.
OL,12,FJust days after tying the knot, the
OL,13,FJersey couple travelled to Cardiff to
OL,14,Ftake part in the race while raising
OL,15,Fmoney for The Brain Tumour Charity.
OL,17,FRyan was diagnosed with a brain tumour
OL,18,Fin 2022 and had planned to take on the
OL,19,Frace alone until wedding plans got in
OL,20,Fthe way.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
